# Enforce LF in working trees on every platform. The repository's committed
# blobs are LF; several executable gates scan source files for \n-joined
# patterns, and the migration-ratchet baseline records sha1s of route-file
# BYTES — a CRLF-smudged checkout (Windows autocrlf) breaks both. text=auto
# leaves binary files untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
